dazestack-wp (0.1.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.1.1: Production hardening from live Ubuntu 26.04 LTS deployment.
  * Resolved FastCGI 0-byte stream truncation behind CDNs/Cloudflare by defaulting dynamic brotli/zstd to off.
  * Retained static-only precompressed assets (brotli_static on, zstd_static on).
  * Added origin compression CLI toggle commands (compression-enable-origin-brotli/zstd).
  * Auto-skip ppa:ondrej/php and third-party Redis repo on Ubuntu 26+; use canonical native packages.
  * Conditioned php-opcache check for PHP 8.5+ where OPcache is compiled directly into core.
  * Pinned official OpenSSL QUIC dependency to openssl-3.5.1 LTS for GCC 15 compatibility.
  * Switched default cache purge repo to actively maintained nginx-modules/ngx_cache_purge.
  * Enforced UFW firewall rules before initializing Fail2ban jail with dynamic SSH port.
  * Added resolve_nginx_source_version in build_nginx_from_source to prevent 404s.

 -- Ashish Dungdung <mail@ashishdungdung.com>  Fri, 04 Sep 2026 12:17:00 +0530

dazestack-wp (0.1.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.1.0 for Ubuntu 24.04 and 26.04 LTS.
  * Added native kernel stack, BBRv3, and TCP Fast Open tuning.
  * Added Post-Quantum TLS 1.3 curve (X25519MLKEM768) and 8k SSL buffers.
  * Added MariaDB 11.4 LTS and Redis LTS with high-performance Unix socket.
  * Added PHP 8.4/8.5 OPcache JIT tracing support.

 -- Ashish Dungdung <mail@ashishdungdung.com>  Fri, 04 Sep 2026 08:00:00 +0530
